{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48210","headline":"与赵神德互嘲 · 梁宝","name":"与赵神德互嘲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赵神德，天上既无云，闪电何以无准则。\n向者入门来，案後惟见一挺墨。\n官里料朱砂，半眼供一国。\n磨公小拇指，涂得太社北。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁宝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48210.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48210","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}